  "title": "Strawberry-Vanilla Freezer Jam",
  "description": "This strawberry-vanilla freezer jam recipe is easy — just stir mashed strawberries, sugar, lemon juice, and pectin together, thicken, then freeze.",
  "authors": [
    "foodinjars (Marisa McClellan)"
  ],
